{"allowed_english": [], "context": {"approved_glossary_entries": [], "generation_contexts": [{"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:04ND:proof/0001", "hash": "sha256:d4c2219df4d7a4e58a72ed03932537fe5e0f720e3473c373b8e226c6509fb2c5", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 302278, "byte_start": 300905, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:41b2b273cda41f25189f7193a98ec24e3d6ec68d65188831bab5f3b923365067", "line_end": 7966, "line_start": 7928}, "owner_tag": "04ND", "parent_tag": "04R5", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04R5", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0002": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\mathcal{O}_{U', u'} & \\mathcal{O}_{V', v'} \\ar[l] \\\\\n\\mathcal{O}_{U, u} \\ar[u] & \\mathcal{O}_{V, v} \\ar[l] \\ar[u]\n}\n$$", "MATH_0002": "$R = \\mathcal{O}_{V, v}$", "MATH_0003": "$S = \\mathcal{O}_{U, u}$", "MATH_0004": "$M = \\mathcal{O}_{U', u'}$", "MATH_0005": "$$\n\\mathcal{O}_{V', v'} \\otimes_{\\mathcal{O}_{V, v}} \\mathcal{O}_{U, u}\n\\longleftarrow\n\\mathcal{O}_{V', v'}\n$$", "MATH_0006": "$$\n\\mathcal{O}_{U', u'}\n\\longleftarrow\n\\mathcal{O}_{V', v'} \\otimes_{\\mathcal{O}_{V, v}} \\mathcal{O}_{U, u}\n$$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{O}_{U, u}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-local-source-target-at-point}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{algebra-section-etale}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-local-flat-ff}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-flat-permanence}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-flat-base-change}", "REF_0006": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-map-between-etale}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{proof}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{proof}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:1e5df2742906c484091061786a8ec60719d996300cc615831946e7402453d1d8", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f03fd9da1ef7390b82168047380d5b546484fee16c8b5485f5723b7618ad7cd0", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nGiven a diagram as in\nDefinition <REF_0001>\nwe obtain the following diagram of local homomorphisms of local rings\n<MATH_0001>\nNote that the vertical arrows are localizations of <ACCENT_0001>tale ring maps,\nin particular they are essentially of finite presentation, flat,\nand unramified (see\nAlgebra, Section <REF_0002>).\nIn particular the vertical maps are faithfully flat, see\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0003>.\nNow, if the upper horizontal arrow is flat, then the lower horizontal\narrow is flat by an application of\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0004>\nwith <MATH_0002>, <MATH_0003> and\n<MATH_0004>. If the lower horizontal arrow is\nflat, then the ring map\n<MATH_0005>\nis flat by\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0005>.\nAnd the ring map\n<MATH_0006>\nis a localization of a map between <ACCENT_0002>tale ring extensions of\n<MATH_0007>, hence flat by\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0006>.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e27a9deb163d99016b54ef5c013390ecd27fe38fbb12228489f2a78e906aa968", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:04ND:proof/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:04NI:proof/0001", "hash": "sha256:cef9bcc6c4620586580556041027ebf7a7bf55ede18deed8c8849b50511642b9", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 303183, "byte_start": 302588, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:3f72e142f7cae9349d78df5470f49bf98e32d2f33731618fbf30b8d31bb4a08f", "line_end": 7992, "line_start": 7981}, "owner_tag": "04NI", "parent_tag": "04R5", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04R5", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0002": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0003": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0004": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$U'_v \\to U_v$", "MATH_0002": "$U' \\to U$", "MATH_0003": "$U'_v$", "MATH_0004": "$V'_v$", "MATH_0005": "$V'_v$", "MATH_0006": "$\\kappa(v)$", "MATH_0007": "$v' = \\Spec(\\kappa(v'))$", "MATH_0008": "$U'_{v'}$", "MATH_0009": "$U'_v$", "MATH_0010": "$U'_{v'} \\to U'_v \\to U_v$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-etale-over-field}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{morphisms-section-etale}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{proof}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{proof}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:511be6378a6428bfd3ab0b6ed9d6b39b6f6ffaff2caa8ae7f05d4dab3f9d75ed", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e1dd51da0784a1eb8f3dd4365fa47ab227748add57dbfac7e6ce3b219d7795fc", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nNote that <MATH_0001> is <ACCENT_0001>tale as a base change of the <ACCENT_0002>tale\nmorphism <MATH_0002>. The scheme <MATH_0003> is a scheme over <MATH_0004>. By\nMorphisms, Lemma <REF_0001>\nthe scheme <MATH_0005> is a disjoint union of spectra\nof finite separable field extensions of <MATH_0006>.\nOne of these is <MATH_0007>. Hence\n<MATH_0008> is an open and closed subscheme of <MATH_0009> and it follows\nthat <MATH_0010> is <ACCENT_0003>tale (as a composition of an\nopen immersion and an <ACCENT_0004>tale morphism, see\nMorphisms, Section <REF_0002>).\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a13678863eeb43e84f01f6a60f544a21abd9a22ae5004ded1ddfb76fcb9c8d78", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:04NI:proof/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:04NI:lemma/0001", "hash": "sha256:b33a172544456e6e17153c32ed2e3279fa9342dfd310f60cbff4244e4a14af19", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 302586, "byte_start": 302280, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:86f2e1be7acb9d7fe758e8a6edd79b7d1780e922aadd909888fdeacc11efb0d5", "line_end": 7979, "line_start": 7968}, "owner_tag": "04NI", "parent_tag": "04R5", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_